  "id": "4b4d11a38de7a70d18f67291",
  "title": "蒜泥白肉|日日食,好时光",
  "summary": "“如果不把饭吃好，一个人就无法好好思考，好好恋爱，好好睡觉。” —— 弗吉尼亚·伍尔夫《一间自己的房间》 （Virginia Woolf） 蒜泥白肉 今天吃什么好呢？这是所有做饭人都会问出的灵魂拷问。我曾经也很烦恼每天做什么吃。但现在我不再放任自己傻乎乎地烦恼了，我在我的冰箱里寻找答案。 比如，我今天翻出一小盒排骨，一块五花肉。我凝视它们片刻，一些菜名便默默自脑海深处浮现，然后我便明白我要做蒜泥白肉和海带黄豆烧排骨来吃。 蒜泥白肉是比较标准的川菜。川菜馆子里的调味自然比我专业，但是馆子里蒜泥白肉分量给得少啊，一份只有薄薄的几片，肉下面全是黄瓜顶着。我自己做起蒜泥白肉来，肉量往往比较生猛，分量完全取决于我手里的五花肉有多大块了。 比如今日，我将一块将近一斤的五花肉全部煮了，片成了蒜泥白肉。这么多肉当然一顿是吃不…",
  "content": "<p> <b><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>“如果不把饭吃好，一个人就无法好好思考，好好恋爱，好好睡觉。”</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b><span><span><span> </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span> \n—— 弗吉尼亚·伍尔夫《一间自己的房间》\n         </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><i><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（Virginia Woolf）</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></i></p><h2><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>蒜泥白肉</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h2><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>今天吃什么好呢？这是所有做饭人都会问出的灵魂拷问。我曾经也很烦恼每天做什么吃。但现在我不再放任自己傻乎乎地烦恼了，我在我的冰箱里寻找答案。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>比如，我今天翻出一小盒排骨，一块五花肉。我凝视它们片刻，一些菜名便默默自脑海深处浮现，然后我便明白我要做蒜泥白肉和海带黄豆烧排骨来吃。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEixPdEWRv0ZZxmr5w9YCa-xRb9rwltNwK0JP30u95hGwFTUB4rCkyS82OCWJD89lpk2sqKBsd__z4HwDxcPMfDuV44QfXeE_nxvaTDtQ4YtKTrB8qcMypPQlf3jfS65j67EEVr8DiuifNoC9xdPPvR5PjPUEL03YRARUUIESATWJMD8pk8d9BqV97caD6zy/s1702/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260709223409_177_20.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"482\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEixPdEWRv0ZZxmr5w9YCa-xRb9rwltNwK0JP30u95hGwFTUB4rCkyS82OCWJD89lpk2sqKBsd__z4HwDxcPMfDuV44QfXeE_nxvaTDtQ4YtKTrB8qcMypPQlf3jfS65j67EEVr8DiuifNoC9xdPPvR5PjPUEL03YRARUUIESATWJMD8pk8d9BqV97caD6zy/w640-h482/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260709223409_177_20.jpg\" width=\"640\"></a></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>蒜泥白肉是比较标准的川菜。川菜馆子里的调味自然比我专业，但是馆子里蒜泥白肉分量给得少啊，一份只有薄薄的几片，肉下面全是黄瓜顶着。我自己做起蒜泥白肉来，肉量往往比较生猛，分量完全取决于我手里的五花肉有多大块了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>比如今日，我将一块将近一斤的五花肉全部煮了，片成了蒜泥白肉。这么多肉当然一顿是吃不完的。但是不用担心，我明早上还可以把五花肉烫到面条米粉里，再卧个蛋，早上来一碗又有肉又有蛋又有蔬菜的面条or米粉，这么丰盛的早餐有助于我们的大脑开机嚯嚯运行嘛。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我买的这份排骨分量不大，所以在烧的时候，我加了一把黄豆，和海带。海带我吭呲吭呲猛洗了三遍，丢下去红烧。味道蛮蛮好，就是海带上的沙子没有洗干净。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘子叫道：“洗海带叫我啊，我来洗啊！”</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我强调道：“我洗了三遍呢！”</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘子：“不是洗了几遍的问题……总之下次叫我来洗啊！你上次煮海带汤，锅里好多沙子呢。”</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>这样噢，海带还有好多呢，下次再要煮海带，我一定叫橘子洗。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjMKmF-vMbMHI2xpfcGDtuJ7BwRqimPxG42ryju9OZ1l7DL4TEq_3XAvyDVcFJP1MSZ7JnmRB2x-aml3kN1kHsbevZN-np-ZLcQevlr-YFn9v4OrsyQeYOArvXZfb1RigM11uljMkmqQX1GAlPFfUl__KdtbDZD-kR0-Pg_DRIjiekwSCJxz8NBZIcRCde6/s1702/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260709223408_176_20.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjMKmF-vMbMHI2xpfcGDtuJ7BwRqimPxG42ryju9OZ1l7DL4TEq_3XAvyDVcFJP1MSZ7JnmRB2x-aml3kN1kHsbevZN-np-ZLcQevlr-YFn9v4OrsyQeYOArvXZfb1RigM11uljMkmqQX1GAlPFfUl__KdtbDZD-kR0-Pg_DRIjiekwSCJxz8NBZIcRCde6/w482-h640/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260709223408_176_20.jpg\" width=\"482\"></a></div><span><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>蒜泥白肉我把佐料调得有点辣，大家吃得嘶嘶作响，像一窝小蛇。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我看着自己制作调料里红红的剁辣椒，想起了英国作家扶霞，她在《鱼翅与花椒》写道：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>四川地区吃辛辣的传统至少可以追溯到一千六百年前。东晋四川史学家常璩评论家乡人“尚滋味”、“好辛香”。来到四川你才会发现，这不算是他们自己的选择，而是跟“环境决定论”有关。四川盆地气候潮湿：冬天，暗暗的湿气会穿透每一层衣服；夏天则是不可忍受的闷热，阳光永远躲在一层蒙蒙的雾气后面。中医的</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>传统理论认为，人的身体是一个能量系统，干湿、冷热和阴阳都必须平衡调和；要是不调和，就必然生病。盆地潮湿的空气将川妹子的皮肤养得吹弹可破、青春永驻，但也动摇了整个身体的平衡。所以，这里的人们从有记忆开始，就像尽义务般地进行自我食疗，吃干辣的热性食物，中和有些“调皮”的气候。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>辣椒最早出现在中国是十六世纪，刚从南美归来的葡萄牙贸易商扬帆前往东方的港口。沿海地区的中国人一开始把辣椒当作好看的观赏植物：洁白的小花，生机勃勃的红果。到后来他们才开始把这辛辣开胃的果实用作调味。商人们通过长江三角洲的水路运辣椒北上，来到华中的湖南，再从那里沿河稍微往西，到了四川。在这两个湿热的省份，辣椒终于找到了自己灵魂的归属。这里的人们等的就是辣椒，他们的医学和饮食观里，早就给辣椒留好了一块用武之地。那鲜红耀眼的颜色照亮</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>了永远雾蒙蒙的天空，那炽烈如火的热气逼出了人们体内的湿气，给他们的生活带来美味的平衡。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>辣椒的确是川渝人士的挚爱。没有辣椒的菜品是那么温和而平淡。我得承认，我的确很爱辣椒。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></span><h2><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>多出来的小狗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h2><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>这个夏季的初夏时光的某一天，一只小柴犬突兀地出现。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>这是村里某一户人养的小狗，她总是从一条特定的小路上出现，然后跑进我们的院子和屋子。一开始小柴犬还谨慎，还要观察我们的神情，担心我们不悦。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>随着时间的进行，现在已经演变成早晨橘子还没有开门，便已经听见小柴犬正在屋外推门。她哐哐推我们的屋门，看我们起床没。一旦橘子开门，小柴犬就冲进屋内，如果小胖的饭盆里还有剩余的狗粮，小柴犬就把它们全部吃光，将盆舔得亮晶晶的。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>做完这一切之后，小柴犬就理所当然地在我们屋内躺下，开始休养生息了。中途小柴犬会出去遛弯散步，但她总是出去没多久便又重新刷新在我们屋内躺下睡觉了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>小胖从一开始有点烦小柴犬，如今也变得对她容忍，或者说对小柴犬开始熟视无睹了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>总之，如今的状况是我们还没有起床，小柴犬就已经在屋门外等着咣咣砸门了，到了夜里我们要关屋门了，小柴犬还赖在屋里不肯回自己的家，经常要我们无奈地把她推出门去，才能关上屋门。这只小狗简直是在我们这里起早摸黑地上班。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>【由于是明确知道有主人的小狗，所以我们不能养，只能每天硬着心肠劝说小狗回自己家去】</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>这个小狗应该在自己的原生家庭里吃得不好，毛摸起来十分粗糙。她很高兴在我们每天有猫条吃，有狗粮吃，有冻干鹌鹑和带肉的猪骨。她每天惬意地在屋里翻着肚皮酣睡，心情十分愉悦。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>这狗的主人白日里简直是根本见不着自己的狗啊。柴犬这种犬种，看来是会为自己找下家的犬种啊。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><div></div><br><p><br></p><h2><u><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>紫苏烧虾</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></h2><br><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>耐心是应付任何情况的巧妙办法。人们必须和一切事物一起共振，热衷于一切事物，同时又必须平静耐心。不能弯曲，不能折裂。只能克服，始于自我克服的克服。人们不能逃避这一点。逃离这条轨道就是崩溃。人们必须耐心地吸收一切，耐心地成长。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br><br><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>——《卡夫卡谈话录》</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>作者：〔奥地利〕弗朗茨·卡夫卡（口述）</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>     〔捷克〕古斯塔夫·雅诺施（记述）</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br><span><span> </span></span><br><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjAx4UIw_X-pMIIKim0izpMqKGm1Fr_lqB2hJlkkhyG0f7Ew0sTC3KQDp2ZZoe-8BtmDJr7jZDfJwABzjlkPk5ZV45_RhzH6Ah6FK9uOsQltKAZZZ6agla17Fj1UndVHMFdv_6J1VsZ64WudIxmbcNWbShsh5XSSdZ5KHeUOV5ZNq230ens_zz06ecjdUQW/s1702/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260712141841_183_20.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjAx4UIw_X-pMIIKim0izpMqKGm1Fr_lqB2hJlkkhyG0f7Ew0sTC3KQDp2ZZoe-8BtmDJr7jZDfJwABzjlkPk5ZV45_RhzH6Ah6FK9uOsQltKAZZZ6agla17Fj1UndVHMFdv_6J1VsZ64WudIxmbcNWbShsh5XSSdZ5KHeUOV5ZNq230ens_zz06ecjdUQW/w482-h640/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260712141841_183_20.jpg\" width=\"482\"></a></div><br><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘子在帮我洗虾，他干这些活儿特别细致，他正剪开虾背挑起细细的虾线。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>“有的虾，虾线是白的。里面啥也没有。”橘子说。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>“哎呀，是饿肚子的虾。”我说，“好可怜的虾。”</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>为了不辜负可怜的虾，我去院子里摘了紫苏，切了仔姜丝，打算很认真地做红烧虾，让每一只虾都死得其所。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>虾用少量的两面煎一下，当煎红以后，淋入醋、生抽、老抽，撒点白砂糖，我手里还有一点朝天椒，我剁碎了两根一起加到锅里烧。等烧了差不多十来分钟，放入仔姜和紫苏叶子。红烧虾的烹饪时间短，虾不用烧很久，大约15-20分钟就可以出锅了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我把紫苏叶子从红烧汁里捞起来先铺到碟子里，等虾的汤汁收得干一点后，再将虾们一只一只夹起来垒到碟子里。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘子很爱这道菜。他喜欢这种弹牙又入味儿的虾。 “真好吃啊！”他说，“虾肉咬起来脆脆的，肉质还很结实。而且这样做也不油，一顿饭吃下来没有负担，好满足啊！”</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhCjlSVCTDoUjKJbrZ6CWGPnrlH41HGfKdUfg5HoyeXYazzueaFOduNuMu8yUXCHUWgXJ8ug6srnVkesRGDBsJxkjg5Tc5mtMdtagsrRS1ELbUzSe4Z1lSKnuV40TrXTBxIR1sbY3n_XiSGcQiCbeNO0ZMAn23JMc1RacPUULfEd4QdiC_aUTEb4i6Kk9yM/s1702/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260712141840_182_20.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhCjlSVCTDoUjKJbrZ6CWGPnrlH41HGfKdUfg5HoyeXYazzueaFOduNuMu8yUXCHUWgXJ8ug6srnVkesRGDBsJxkjg5Tc5mtMdtagsrRS1ELbUzSe4Z1lSKnuV40TrXTBxIR1sbY3n_XiSGcQiCbeNO0ZMAn23JMc1RacPUULfEd4QdiC_aUTEb4i6Kk9yM/w482-h640/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260712141840_182_20.jpg\" width=\"482\"></a></p><h2><span><span><span><span><b><span><span><span><span><span><span>凉拌豆腐，肉末茄子</span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></h2><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>最近天气火热，连晴高温，大家的胃口出了一定程度的下滑，油腻的肉菜很难在酷暑下吞下腹去。于是我的夏季菜谱开始比较多凉拌菜了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>凉拌豆腐我选的是内酯豆腐。这种豆腐是用葡萄糖内酯和黄豆制作的，没有用石膏点豆腐，内酯豆腐质地细腻，豆腥味淡，用来做凉拌豆腐再合适不过了。将内酯豆腐蒸熟，淋点酱油，加一勺剁辣椒，撒点柴鱼末，简单的制作就能得到好滋味的菜品。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>肉末茄子在夏天，我把它也做成了一道凉拌菜。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>茄子我是也先蒸软了的。茄子这个菜吧，如果不蒸软，想要炒软，就需要大量的油。酷热的夏天，谁吃得消那么多油啊，大家都受不了油腻，所以蒸茄子然后凉拌是最为适合的。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>在蒸软的茄子上，浇上蒜泥汁，再把炒好的肉末盖在上面，顿时就有荤有素，蛋白质有，素菜也有了~完美！</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><div><span><span><span><span><span><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgVyVVMAIxNJ1yrLUNOHITQmEKr9FbNASAiXJARRgmebw9o9ua2RjNEJrPMcVlUbDqW-OUKgN6DeYADtRmJuXWO7Y2HBpsBIG80mxrevODtaKuFqIM-nlcbH9rmp3i05EXTkUnzDfr7ttD79Bc6pGwOuyEXESaGHvahEb7CAPzjraHzRZ22jjKHBdEidSwg/s1702/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260714131147_208_20.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgVyVVMAIxNJ1yrLUNOHITQmEKr9FbNASAiXJARRgmebw9o9ua2RjNEJrPMcVlUbDqW-OUKgN6DeYADtRmJuXWO7Y2HBpsBIG80mxrevODtaKuFqIM-nlcbH9rmp3i05EXTkUnzDfr7ttD79Bc6pGwOuyEXESaGHvahEb7CAPzjraHzRZ22jjKHBdEidSwg/w482-h640/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260714131147_208_20.jpg\" width=\"482\"></a></span></span></span></span></span></div><span><span><span><span><span><br><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span><p></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>***写在文后***</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>“今天天气这么好，我们必须吃一顿长达三个小时的美味午餐，因为不享受阳光和松露是对生命的浪费。”</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>这是在《普罗旺斯的一年》的彼得·梅尔和当地人的生活逻辑。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>生活的本质从来不在于你发明了多少个新词去“解构”它，而在于你有没有真正去</span></span><b><span><span><span>享用</span></span></span></b><span><span><span>它。</span></span></span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>真正的丰盛，从不需要活得像一个严丝合缝的样板间。它时常带着一点缺憾和不完美，比如调料不够齐全、花生苗买回来有点老、甚至偶尔看书忘记时间把排骨烧干，但院子里的紫苏是鲜活的，盘子里的牛肉是被吃得精光的，身边的狗子和猫咪都是能随时感知和互动的。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>这种带点粗粝、有烟火气、敢于敞开真实的关系，才是本自具足、无法被任何精致概念伪造的、真正属于我们的丰盛人生。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>好啦，今天也是好好吃饭的寻常一日哦~</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>谢谢各位的阅读，我们下回再见！</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>【回头见】</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>",
  "image": "https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEixPdEWRv0ZZxmr5w9YCa-xRb9rwltNwK0JP30u95hGwFTUB4rCkyS82OCWJD89lpk2sqKBsd__z4HwDxcPMfDuV44QfXeE_nxvaTDtQ4YtKTrB8qcMypPQlf3jfS65j67EEVr8DiuifNoC9xdPPvR5PjPUEL03YRARUUIESATWJMD8pk8d9BqV97caD6zy/s72-w640-h482-c/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260709223409_177_20.jpg",
